Package: qr-bridge
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, python3 (>= 3.8), python3-gi, gir1.2-gtk-3.0
Description: send text between computer and phone via QR code
 QR Bridge shows text (for example, a proxy key) as a QR code to scan
 with a phone, and receives text from the phone through a web page on
 the local network. Nothing has to be installed on the phone.
 .
 The interface is available in English and Russian.
